{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1948afa6-84ae-87f8-b2ed-7e9942a4d367",
  "created_at": "2025-12-26T13:11:03-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Canvassing",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ana E. Souza",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Walter Tavares",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:07:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Canvassing, this is Walter. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:07:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. Yes, hello. I am calling because I have moved, and I was told I must do something about my voting. Kindly tell me how I register again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:07:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Did you move within Newport, or from another city or town?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:07:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Within Newport. I was on one street for many years, and now I am in an apartment on another. I am a renter now. Is that a problem?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:07:54-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, renting is fine. Since you're still in Newport, you just need to update your address on your voter registration. You can fill out a voter registration form with your new address, and that updates your record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:08:06-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A form. I see. And where would I get this form? I do not have a computer. I have only the telephone, and I am not very good with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:08:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We can mail one to you, or you can pick one up here at the canvassing office at City Hall. Would you rather come in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:08:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would rather come in, yes. [pause] I am sorry, you are very faint. I have you on the speaker, because I cannot hold the telephone and the paper at the same time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:08:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. Is this better? I'll speak up. I said you can pick up a form here at City Hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:08:42-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is better, thank you. Now, if I fill in the form at home, may I bring it back to you? What are the hours of your office, kindly? I do not want to make the trip for nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:08:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. We're open weekdays, generally during regular business hours, morning through late afternoon. Today being the day after Christmas, I'd call ahead before you come in, in case hours are adjusted around the holiday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:09:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, yes, the holiday. I had forgotten. So I should telephone first. Is it this same number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:09:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, this same line, the canvassing office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:09:15-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I would write that down, but my grandchild set up my new telephone, and I cannot find the contacts. She put everything in it, and now it is all hidden from me. I press and press and nothing shows."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:09:28-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, that happens. Well, you've reached us now, so if you jot down the number as you hear it from the caller screen or from the City Hall main listing, you'll have it. Or I can tell you to look it up in the phone book under the city offices."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:09:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The phone book, yes. I still have one. That is more my speed. Now, the form. Do I need to bring some paper to show where I live? A letter, perhaps?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:09:54-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The form asks for your driver's license or state ID number, or the last four digits of your Social Security number. If you don't have either, we can tell you what else works. The form explains it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:10:06-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have an identification card from the state. I think it still has my old address. Is that a difficulty?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:10:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The ID number is what we need, so the old address on the card is okay for registering. You may want to get the card updated at the registry separately."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:10:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. So I do two things, then. One with you and one with the registry. I thought it was only one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:10:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They're separate, yes. Voter registration is with us, and your ID card is with the registry. Doing ours first is the important one for voting."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:10:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. Forgive me, I am a little muddled. So I fill in the form, I telephone first, and then I bring it to City Hall to you. Is that correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:10:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Or you can mail it. Either way works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:10:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then I will bring it. Thank you very much, Mr. Tavares. Kindly forgive my questions."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:10:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble at all. Take care, and happy holidays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:11:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And to you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
